# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Scratch / diff dumps — never commit these. Comparison/diff output from an
# interactive agent session belongs in a scratch dir outside the working
# tree, never in the checkout (Bug #95668 — cruft reached main via a normal
# PR merge, undetected, because nothing stopped it at commit time).
.tmp*
*.diff
*.patch
*.orig
*.rej
*_diff.txt
*_diff.md
diff.txt
diff_output.txt
scratch.txt
dump.txt

# Stack: Next.js + TypeScript (Technical-Context.MD)
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
npm-debug.log*
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Secrets -- the CricAPI key never enters git
.env*

# Spec/Plan docs are transient local artifacts written by /factory-brainstorming and
# /factory-writing-plans, each of which pushes its own artefact's exact contents
# directly into the ADO Feature's Custom.Specification /
# Custom.ImplementationPlan fields on approval — ADO, not git, is the durable
# copy on this repo.
# Ignored (not just left untracked) so generic git-hygiene tooling doesn't
# flag them as forgotten uncommitted work.
docs/superpowers/specs/
docs/superpowers/plans/
